---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT * FROM (SELECT a, 's' AS k FROM t UNION ALL SELECT a, 'u' AS k FROM u) x WHERE k = 'z'"
---
Union
:- Project [a#0, 's' AS k#3]
:  +- Filter false
:     +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0]
+- Project [a#4, 'u' AS k#6]
   +- Filter false
      +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#4]
